#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/callbacks.md
#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/callbacks.md:7
msgid "CallbackManager"
msgstr "CallbackManager"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/callbacks.md:9
msgid ""
"`Optimizer` delegates notifications about execution progress to "
"`CallbackManager`. CallbackManager supports observation such as logging, "
"collecting convergence history, and making conditional decisions. Events "
"observe execution boundaries; changing an Event field does not replace a "
"Pipeline input."
msgstr ""
"`Optimizer` は、実行経過を外部へ通知する処理を `CallbackManager` に委譲します。 "
"CallbackManagerは、ログ記録、収束履歴の収集、条件判断などの観測に使います。 "
"Eventは実行境界の観測用であり、Eventのフィールドを書き換えてPipelineの入力を差し替える仕組みではありません。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/callbacks.md:13
msgid "CallbackManager's role"
msgstr "CallbackManagerの役割"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/callbacks.md:15
msgid "`CallbackManager` keeps a list of handlers per event type."
msgstr "`CallbackManager`は、イベント型ごとにハンドラのリストを保持します。"

